With Studio, the dashboard has a Coaching side (switch at the top of the sidebar). The Studio
walkthrough in Guide takes you through it in ten short chapters, doing each thing for real.

## Practise on sample clients

The first Studio chapter offers three sample clients: Niamh, who asks to join through your first
invite link; Conor, already your client, who answers check-ins and messages; and Dara, who shares only
her training. They act on their own a few seconds after you do something, and only you ever see them.

Keep them as a sandbox to try programs and forms on. Manage them from Clients › Sandbox: Reset to fresh
puts back their starting four weeks, Remove deletes them and everything they sent, and Add sample
clients brings them back.

